---
<section class="contenedor layout-gap overflow-wrapper">
  <div>
    <div class="heading-align left">
      <div class="title-wrapper arrow-left">
        <h2>The problem</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <ul class="custom-list">
      <li>Accelerator physics is critical for medicine, industry, and research.</li>
      <li>There is a gap between student training and the real needs of the sector.</li>
      <li>Most universities do not have access to accelerators due to cost, complexity, and security.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="btn-container">
    <a href="#solution" class="btn">See how we address this</a>
  </div>

  <div id="solution">
    <div class="heading-align right">
      <div class="title-wrapper arrow-right">
        <h2>The solution</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid-2-col cards-grid">
      <div class="card card-centered">
        <h3 class="card-title">ALOHA</h3>
        <img src="/aloha.jpg" alt="ALOHA Accelerator" class="card-img" width="300" height="200" style="background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); object-fit: contain;" />
        <p class="card-subtitle">A safe, modular, and affordable desktop accelerator.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card card-centered">
        <h3 class="card-title">The ELIAC<br/>competition</h3>
        <img src="/eliac.jpg" alt="ELIAC Competition" class="card-img" width="300" height="200" style="background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);" />
        <p class="card-subtitle">Teams of European students designing and simulating their own LINACs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Evita que las líneas expansivas generen scroll horizontal */
  .overflow-wrapper {
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  .layout-gap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 5rem;
  }

  /* Alineación de encabezados */
  .heading-align { 
    display: flex; 
    margin-bottom: 3rem; 
  }
  .heading-align.left { justify-content: flex-start; }
  .heading-align.right { justify-content: flex-end; }

  /* Títulos con flechas y líneas degradadas */
  .title-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .arrow-left::after, .arrow-right::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    height: 2px;
  }

  /* Flecha de izquierda a derecha */
  .arrow-left::after {
    left: -1000px; /* Longitud arbitraria larga para que se pierda por la izquierda */
    right: -20px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, var(--c-red) 100%);
  }
  .arrow-left::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -4px;
    right: -25px;
    border-top: 5px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 5px solid transparent;
    border-left: 10px solid var(--c-red);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Flecha de derecha a izquierda */
  .arrow-right::after {
    right: -1000px; /* Longitud arbitraria larga para que se pierda por la derecha */
    left: -20px;
    background: linear-gradient(270deg, transparent 0%, var(--c-red) 100%);
  }
  .arrow-right::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -4px;
    left: -25px;
    border-top: 5px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 5px solid transparent;
    border-right: 10px solid var(--c-red);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Lista personalizada (cuadrados en lugar de círculos) */
  .custom-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 3.5rem;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-left: 2rem;
  }

  .custom-list li {
    position: relative;
    font-family: var(--ff-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .custom-list li::before {
    content: "▪";
    position: absolute;
    left: -1.5rem;
    color: var(--c-text);
    font-size: 1.2em; /* Hace el cuadrado ligeramente más visible */
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  /* Tarjetas centradas */
  .cards-grid {
    gap: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .card-centered {
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    background: rgba(30, 30, 50, 0.4); /* Leve ajuste para que resalte del fondo como en la foto */
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  /* Ajustes Mobile */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .custom-list {
      margin-left: 0;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>